Origin and modifications
------------------------

Hermit for Android is a modified version of Moonlight for Android (moonlight-android), developed by
Cameron Gutman, Diego Waxemberg and the Moonlight contributors and licensed under the GNU General
Public License v3.0. The original project and its history are available at:

  https://github.com/moonlight-stream/moonlight-android

As required by section 5(a) of the GPLv3: this version was modified by Juno Park in 2026. The
modifications include, among others, the Hermit name, artwork, theme and Korean translation; a new
Java package (com.junopark.hermit), application ID and native library name (hermit-core); direct
touch and trackpad input, pinch zoom, a text input bar, a virtual keypad with a quick menu, a stream
settings panel with live and automatic bitrate control, a performance overlay, session summaries,
clipboard sync, remote shutdown and restart, automatic reconnect, on-device crash reports, and the
removal of the upstream project's online services. The git history of this repository starts with the
modified version.


